cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the Archetype Atlas, please cite it as below and name the
  release you used. Original data and documentation are CC BY 4.0, so
  attribute them as "Archetype Atlas, Energy-Atlas" with the release number.
type: dataset
title: Building Energy Archetype Atlas
abstract: >-
  Deterministic, source-traceable building-energy semantics for urban building
  energy modeling: program loads and schedules, envelope components, HVAC
  definitions, and building/program assignments, with field-level provenance,
  from ComStock, ResStock, OpenStudio Standards, the DOE Commercial Reference
  Buildings and the DOE/PNNL Prototype Building Models. Published as versioned
  release folders, with an optional stochastic schedule generator
  (atlas-schedules).
authors:
  - name: Energy-Atlas
version: 2.2.0
date-released: '2026-10-30'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Energy-Atlas/archetype-atlas'
url: 'https://energy-atlas.github.io/archetype-atlas/'
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - building energy modeling
  - urban building energy modeling
  - archetypes
  - EnergyPlus
  - occupancy schedules
